1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,210
Most AI agents still live in a tab.

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:04,513
Their memory expires with the session.

3
00:00:04,513 --> 00:00:06,180
Their tools feel disconnected.

4
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:08,819
And their decisions disappear behind an answer.

5
00:00:08,819 --> 00:00:10,995
Hallow changes where the agent lives.

6
00:00:10,995 --> 00:00:19,513
It is an open-source Agent OS installed directly on your PC, with a private runtime, a durable workspace, and an operator in control.

7
00:00:19,513 --> 00:00:26,689
One command builds the runtime, verifies its dependencies, starts the managed service, and opens the desktop.

8
00:00:26,689 --> 00:00:27,939
No Git ritual.

9
00:00:27,939 --> 00:00:29,560
No maze of services.

10
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:31,782
From a clean machine to a living agent.

11
00:00:31,782 --> 00:00:33,784
Ask for an outcome in plain English.

12
00:00:33,784 --> 00:00:42,719
Hallow recalls the right context, scopes the workspace, selects bounded tools, and turns the request into a mission that can keep working beyond a single reply.

13
00:00:42,719 --> 00:00:44,560
Intelligence becomes a system.

14
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:46,886
Route between local and cloud models.

15
00:00:46,886 --> 00:00:48,993
Connect MCP tools.

16
00:00:48,993 --> 00:00:50,752
Reuse tested skills.

17
00:00:50,752 --> 00:00:54,282
Keep memory close—and keep policy outside the prompt.

18
00:00:54,282 --> 00:00:59,687
Long-running work gets a queue, checkpoints, retries, evidence, and history.

19
00:00:59,687 --> 00:01:00,601
Schedule it.

20
00:01:00,601 --> 00:01:01,539
Resume it.

21
00:01:01,539 --> 00:01:05,601
Inspect every stage without rebuilding the context from zero.

22
00:01:05,601 --> 00:01:09,085
When an action crosses a sensitive boundary, Hallow stops.

23
00:01:09,085 --> 00:01:14,583
You see the exact target, change, evidence, and risk before anything leaves the machine.

24
00:01:14,583 --> 00:01:16,122
Autonomy moves quickly.

25
00:01:16,122 --> 00:01:17,638
Consent stays human.

26
00:01:17,638 --> 00:01:21,018
And when work fails, failure becomes evidence.

27
00:01:21,018 --> 00:01:30,555
Doctor checks, readiness proofs, traces, reflection, and controlled recovery help the agent explain what broke, repair safely, and verify again.

28
00:01:30,555 --> 00:01:31,909
This is the difference.

29
00:01:31,909 --> 00:01:33,599
Not a temporary chat session.

30
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:35,162
An installable runtime.

31
00:01:35,162 --> 00:01:36,655
Not rented context.

32
00:01:36,655 --> 00:01:38,043
Durable local memory.

33
00:01:38,043 --> 00:01:40,381
Not one model locked to one workflow.

34
00:01:40,381 --> 00:01:44,062
Routing, tools, MCP, and tested skills.

35
00:01:44,062 --> 00:01:46,180
Not action without accountability.

36
00:01:46,180 --> 00:01:49,918
Approvals, traces, readiness, and recovery.

37
00:01:49,918 --> 00:01:50,821
Your machine.

38
00:01:50,821 --> 00:01:51,701
Your memory.

39
00:01:51,701 --> 00:01:52,604
Your agent.

40
00:01:52,604 --> 00:01:54,120
Hallow Agent OS.

41
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:58,923
Install the intelligence that keeps working—and keeps you in control.

